# what building and running a sample leaves beside its source: executables without an extension, wasm, wast
**/*
!**/*.*
!**/
**/*.wasm
**/*.wast
# the prebuilt component wasm/component_reflection.warp uses (shapes.wasm, which wasm/import_compiled.warp imports,
# is built from wasm/shapes.warp: warp's scripts/samples.sh builds it)
!wasm/rust_demo.wasm
# what samples write beside themselves: database tables (storage/orm), stored values (storage/store), pictures
# (graphics/load_bmp, make_image), a tune (sound)
**/*.database.sqlite
**/*.stored.json
graphics/evening.bmp
graphics/sunset.bmp
**/tune.mid
**/.DS_Store
